110 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I want to create a \215tea maker\216 python program that determines the perfect tea for someone depending on their preferences\056 \nSome of these preferences include mood\054 sweetness\054 toppings\054 and temperature\056 With that\054 the program will extract elements from a list \050depending on each preference\051 and combine to ultimately make the perfect tea\056 \n\nAsk the user their name\nIntroduce the program to them\nAsk the user about how they are currently feeling given a selection of emotions\nAsk a series of would\055you\055rather questions in an odd number\nAsk the user if they like their tea hot or cold\nAsk the user if they like their tea on the sweeter or bitter side \055\055\076 if it is neither or either\054 give them the option of tart\057sour\nUse their would\055you\055rather answers to determined toppings)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 109 0 R
     /Pg 106 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
